{%- comment -%}
  Casa Di Lumo — Policy template

  NOTE (2026-05-12): Shopify's OS 2.0 / Horizon renderer for /policies/*
  URLs bypasses theme templates entirely — this file is NOT picked up
  for /policies/refund-policy, /policies/privacy-policy, etc. Those
  URLs render through Shopify's built-in .shopify-policy__container
  markup, styled via overrides in assets/casa-base.css.

  This file is left in place as a no-op fallback for any case where
  Shopify eventually starts honoring policy.liquid again. It renders
  the casa-policy-page section, which is also available for merchant
  Pages that mirror policy content via Page resources with the
  "policy-page" theme template assignment.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% section 'casa-policy-page' %}
